                                "sense_id": "f0133211-2b8c-313e-823a-a0b1857554bf",
                                "text": "to those Jewish faithed brethren QPR fans of which Mike and myself are two, for the year, and myself apologise^([sic]) to anyone whom I have hurt (sinned) during the past year."
